Description: MissionDebug web UI (static dist)
 Built React + PixiJS UI for replaying captured MCAP sessions. Installs
 the static dist to /var/lib/missiondebug/web/; the backend serves it
 from there at http://<host>:8000/.
 .
 No separate web service — the backend handles both /api and the static
 files on the same port.

